OL,3,GNEWSAChildren 'not safe' as services
OL,4,Arated inadequate
OL,5,
OL,6,FChildren under the care of Dudley
OL,7,FCouncil have been put at risk and are
OL,8,Funsafe, according to Ofsted.
OL,10,FAn inspection by the watchdog in July
OL,11,Frated all areas of children's services
OL,12,Fas inadequate, finding that they had
OL,13,Fdeteriorated since a previous visit in
OL,14,F2022.
OL,16,FInspectors found "for too many
OL,17,Fchildren, ineffective and, for some
OL,18,Fchildren, unsafe practice, and an
OL,19,Fabsence of effective management
OL,20,Foversight, have resulted in them living
OL,21,Fin circumstances of risk for too long".
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
